---
title: User Registration Sequence Diagram
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (UI)
    participant RegisterComponent
    participant UserService
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database

    User->>RegisterComponent: Fill registration form
    RegisterComponent->>RegisterComponent: Validate form fields
    RegisterComponent->>UserService: Call registerUser(request)
    UserService->>API: POST /users/register (UserRegistrationRequest)
    API->>DB: Store new user and profile
    DB-->>API: Success/Failure
    alt Registration Success
        API-->>UserService: 201 UserResponse
        UserService-->>RegisterComponent: UserResponse
        RegisterComponent-->>User: Show success message
    else Registration Error
        API-->>UserService: 4xx/5xx ErrorResponse
        UserService-->>RegisterComponent: ErrorResponse
        RegisterComponent-->>User: Show error message
    end
